        "top_score": 0.426,
        "latency_s": 3.68,
        "answer": "Refunds are issued to the original payment method within 5\u20137 business days after our warehouse receives and inspects the return [returns-and-refunds.md]. If a refund has not arrived after 10 business days, you may want to ask your bank about pending ACH reversals [returns-and-refunds.md].",
