        "escalated": false,
        "top_score": 0.625,
        "latency_s": 2.63,
        "answer": "Yes, a blinking red LED on the hub indicates error LL-E30 \"No internet\" [troubleshooting-guide.md]. To resolve this, check the Ethernet cable and your ISP connection, ensuring outbound ports 443 and 8883 are not blocked [troubleshooting-guide.md].",
